# Driv3r: skip the opening FMV, accept default menu choices, then exercise active 3D movement.
repeat Start 120 90 18 5
repeat A 180 90 18 5
repeat B 240 120 8 5
repeat A 1800 150 18 5
repeat Start 4200 180 12 5
repeat A 4800 150 20 5
repeat Down 7200 180 3 7
repeat A 7800 150 12 5
at 9600 Up 1200
at 10800 Right 1200
at 12000 A,Up 1200
at 13800 B,Right 1200
at 15600 L,Right 900
at 16800 R,Up 900
